## Experience Principles

1. **Single voice**: every English page follows the same tone and terminology.
2. **One page, one purpose**: no duplicate explanations or mixed topics.
3. **Copy-ready**: every snippet or command can be used as-is.

## Feedback

Ping CoreBox with the `feedback` command whenever you find a gap or typo—the doc team monitors it in real time.
